  "summary": "US data brokers like Mercor, Surge AI, and AfterQuery are selling roughly half a billion dollars' worth of AI training data to Chinese labs, according to a ChinaTalk investigation. That includes the same RL environments previously built for OpenAI or Anthropic. At least nine firms are involved, and export controls barely apply. The article US data brokers are selling half a billion dollars in RL training environments to Chinese AI labs appeared first on The Decoder .",
